==Trivia==
*The name "Cakenstein" comes from a combination of "Cake" and “Frankenstein”. It is likely a reference to the fact that Cakenstein have two iron nails on his head.
*He is one of the bosses that one can turn into by consuming the [[Boss Cake]].
*The ingredient Glerga used in his creation, which is the possible cause for his sentience, is Mystery Meat.

